      "message": "Done in PS43. The detach-failure path no longer drains RX or reclaims fill-ring buffers unless af_xdp_remove_program() succeeds, so kernel-owned buffers are not reclaimed unless quiescence is confirmed.",
      "parentUuid": "11261f50_0104b156",
      "revId": "eb39bb54afdd1b4307a8e8d778368be6f45d6489",
